 "mapping": {
  "author": "claude-mapper-wave3",
  "date": "2026-11-06",
  "draft_py": "# M20 Shifting Ceratops\n# 1. \"This spell can't be countered.\" is the compiler's (B14), compiled[0].\n# 2. \"Protection from blue\": PROTECTION with a COLOR_HAS param (Sporeweb Weaver's \"hexproof from\n#    blue\" param; Baneslayer Angel / Sparkhunter Masticore's PROTECTION keyword).\n# 3. \"{G}: This creature gains your choice of reach, trample, or haste until end of turn.\": Alchemist's\n#    Gift's resolution-time Choose over GRANT_ABILITY options (B5b-choice-of-grants), each option the\n#    activated self-grant of Goblin Bird-Grabber \"{R}: This creature gains flying until end of turn.\"\n#    (B3-grant-kw-self). Options in printed order.\nkeywords = [\n    KeywordAbility(keyword=Keyword.PROTECTION, params=(FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.COLOR_HAS, color='U'),)),\n]\nthis_creature = Selector(\n    count=QConst(value=1),\n    mode=SelectorMode.ALL,\n    filter=FAnd(\n        children=(\n            FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.CONTROLLER_IS, who=ControllerRef.YOU),\n            FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_SOURCE),\n        ),\n    ),\n    zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n)\nchoice = ActivatedAbility(\n    cost=Cost(parts=(CostManaColor(color='G', amount=QConst(value=1)),)),\n    effect=Choose(\n        count=QConst(value=1),\n        options=(\n            A(Verb.GRANT_ABILITY, {\n                'ability': KeywordAbility(keyword=Keyword.REACH),\n                'duration': DurationEot(),\n                'target': this_creature,\n            }),\n            A(Verb.GRANT_ABILITY, {\n                'ability': KeywordAbility(keyword=Keyword.TRAMPLE),\n                'duration': DurationEot(),\n                'target': this_creature,\n            }),\n            A(Verb.GRANT_ABILITY, {\n                'ability': KeywordAbility(keyword=Keyword.HASTE),\n                'duration': DurationEot(),\n                'target': this_creature,\n            }),\n        ),\n    ),\n)\nabilities = [compiled[0], choice, compiled[1]]\n",
