  "notes": "'This spell can't be countered.' is the compiler's B14 static. 'Protection from blue': PROTECTION with param COLOR_HAS U (the compiler has no general 'Protection from <colour>' line, B-101 residue 3; Sporeweb Weaver's 'hexproof from blue' param). '{G}: ... your choice of reach, trample, or haste': Alchemist's Gift's resolution-time Choose of GRANT_ABILITY options (CR 608.2d; not a mode, query.modal_choose reads spells only), each option Goblin Bird-Grabber's B3 self-grant. Self-check packs (scratch): a blue creature is never asked to block it, a green one is; an opponent's Unsummon can't target it."
